					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#483">Guild in support of BOYCOTT on guild Arirang??</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							I DO!<br />
Looks like there is a server-wide move to boycott the Guild Arirang for their actions against other guilds. As of last night we were told there are 25+ guilds in support of this. As for names, no idea at this time. <br />
<br />
Seems they have made it a regular practice to KS other guilds for Epic parts for the last few months and are now beginning to get an extremely bad name on Rodcet Nife server. Yes, they are an UBER guild with many 55-60 lvl players, SO! WHAT! One of our guild members was in a raid preparing to take out the Wraith of Jaxiom (Enchanter Epic) in the city of mist, when Arirang Guild stormed the location, trained them with the mobs, Killed the wraith and looted it for the Enchanter epic causing a complete wipe-out on our members four groups (50+ people). Anither close friend with a 57 Cleric was on a raid table to kill the Dragon for the Cleric epic. This table is organised by the GM's on our server. As they were preparingto kill the dragon, Arirang shows up and KSes the dragon for a Clerics epic in their guild. Ignoring Rodcet Nife server scheduled list of who can take the dragon. I personally support the Boycott and urge all members of EMF to support it also. Arirang will get no ports, buffs or combines from me.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							<br>
														<strong>By:</strong>
							<span class="name"> <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2602">Buulash Spiderspirit</a> at 12:35 PM PDT - May 30th, 2002</span>
						</td>
					</tr>
