					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#474">IMPORTANT!!!</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Ok everyone, I need everyone in the guild to send me their e-mail addresses except the ones I already have, and you know who you are, hehehe<br />
My e-mail is cranerat@yahoo.com<br />
<br />
This will make scheduling stuff easier especially if the other guild goes live on Eci server. Yes, I AM trying to schedule stuff. I want to start acquiring items for guild assets to start helping others get a life in game with a little variety instead of just &quot;Leveling&quot;<br />
<br />
Generasya, have your mule full of containers as I will start contributing items Buu and others get extra and will start donating cash (Tithe) when I return from hunts. If we can get everyone to start donating we can start getting a bank-roll to help in purchases for items or supplies players need for MAINS, not Alts.
